      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice, that makes me feel way better. i was really panicking but you make it sound like nothing to worry about. i'm gonna go do the water rinse now. just one thing though, my vision is looking a little bit blurry and everything looks kind of fuzzy when i try to look around. is that just from the stinging or should i be worried about that too? i really want to avoid the hospital if i can help it.",
